 35→\title{HyperCluster: Decentralized Large Language Model Inference over Peer-to-Peer Wireless Networks}
 36→%
 37→\titlerunning{HyperCluster: Decentralized LLM Inference}
 38→%
 39→\author{Anonymous Submission}
 40→%
