\caption{Ring pipeline autoregressive generation across 3 nodes (28 layers). \textbf{Top:} Prefill phase---prompt tokens traverse the ring once, with each node processing its assigned layers and forwarding hidden states via QUIC. \textbf{Bottom:} Generation phase---each new token cycles through all nodes; the final node samples the next token and feeds it back to the head node.}
